[00:19.77]1. There was a time we did not know
[00:25.34]The way a Christian ought to go.
[00:31.34]Then Jehovah sent the light,
[00:37.34]His Kingdom truth so clear and bright.
[00:43.34]Our Father’s will we then could see
[00:50.40]To serve the grand Theocracy,
[00:59.40]To declare Jehovah’s fame,
[01:09.02]And help to glorify his holy name.
[01:15.02]We witness now to all we meet,
[01:21.02]From door to door and on the street.
[01:25.35]We take the time to help them see;
[01:29.69]We teach the truth that sets us free.
[01:34.36]And as we strive in ev’ry land
[01:40.70]Jehovah’s worship to expand,
[01:47.04]May we serve our God as one
[01:52.44]Until Jehovah says the work is done.